  Register is deliberately plain and respectful rather than formal-literary:
  the audience is listeners, not scholars. Where an English word is in ordinary
  spoken use (रेडियो, डाउनलोड, थीम) it is kept, because a Sanskritised coinage
  would read as stilted on a phone.
-->
